Cell["\<\
Add onsite, nearest-neighbour, and next-nearest-neighbour shells to obtain \
the Bloch Hamiltonian used below:\
\>", "ExampleText",ExpressionUUID->"c1efd021-1abc-4c1a-9055-b5fb46cd6259"],

