Cell["\<\
ValidationLevel -> \"Full\" additionally checks independence and rank-nullity \
after solving. These checks leave the exact nearest-neighbour Hamiltonian \
unchanged:\
\>", "ExampleText",ExpressionUUID->"e3c4ad1e-2905-4553-89f7-ee3724949e22"],

